@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix whois: <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois#>.

_:B0ad0c6c20ec70bebce5a59ae1d4b473b <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#code> """
<foaf:Person>
 <foaf:name>Masahide Kanzaki</foaf:name>
 <whois:stage rdf:parseType='Resource'>
  <whois:place>Tokyo, Japan</whois:place>
  <whois:since>1982</whois:since>
 </whois:stage>
 <whois:stage rdf:parseType='Resource'>
  <whois:place>Suzuka, Mie, Japan</whois:place>
  <whois:born>1960</whois:born>
  <whois:until>1978</whois:until>
 </whois:stage>
</foaf:Person>
 """;
                                    <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#exampleOf> <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                                    <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#image> <http://www.kanzaki.com/works/2007/misc/whois-vocab-sample1.png>;
                                    <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#pfx> "whois:";
                                    a <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#Example>;
                                    rdfs:comment "Simple, unstructured description. Class tags 'whois:Stage' are omitted by using rdf:parseType='Resource', and 'whois:place' property is used instead of 'whois:where' to have literal values). Note the 'whois:born' (instead of 'whois:since') implies (the omitted 'whois:Stage' is) one's first stage of life, and the stage without 'whois:until' denotes the current phase.",
                                                 "最もシンプルな例（rdf:parseType='Resource'を用いて'whois:Stage'も省略）。場所を単なるリテラルとするためにwhois:placeを用いている。whois:bornを持つwhois:Stageは出身地での人生の最初のステージを示す。また、whois:untilのないwhois:Stageは現在のステージ。"@ja.
_:B32c522e08103056656042f88be4b804b <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#code> """
<whois:stage>
 <whois:Stage>
  <whois:since>1987</whois:since>
  <whois:until>1989</whois:until>
  <whois:where>
   <whois:Place geo:lat=\"40.794\" geo:long=\"-73.972\">
    <contact:country>U.S.A.</contact:country>
    <contact:city>New York</contact:city>
   </whois:Place>
  </whois:where>
  <whois:what>
   <wn:School>
    <foaf:homepage rdf:resource=\"http://www.columbia.edu/cu/business/\"/>
   </wn:School>
  </whois:what>
 </whois:Stage>
</whois:stage>
 """;
                                    <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#exampleOf> <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                                    a <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#Example>;
                                    rdfs:comment "A structured description of a stage of one's life. Note properties from contact: and geo: vocabulary can be used with whois:Place.",
                                                 "whois:where、whois:whatの内容にほかの語彙を含む構造的な記述を利用した例。"@ja.
_:B406a020d78e1c78ba934238ecf4d91cb <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#code> """
<foaf:Person>
 <foaf:name>Masahide Kanzaki</foaf:name>
 <foaf:homepage rdf:resource=\"http://www.kanzaki.com/\"/>
 <whois:stage whois:born=\"1960\" rdfs:label=\"Suzuka, Mie, Japan\"/>
 <whois:career>
  <whois:Education>
   <rdfs:label>Columbia Business School</rdfs:label>
   <whois:since>1987</whois:since>
   <whois:until>1989</whois:until>
  </whois:Education>
 </whois:career>
 <whois:career>
  <whois:Job>
   <rdfs:label>A virtual corporation</rdfs:label>
   <whois:since>1989</whois:since>
   <whois:until>2002</whois:until>
  </whois:Job>
 </whois:career>
 <whois:professionalCareer rdf:parseType=\"Resource\">
  <rdfs:label>Keio University</rdfs:label>
  <whois:since>2003</whois:since>
 </whois:professionalCareer>
</foaf:Person>
 """;
                                    <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#exampleOf> <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                                    a <http://purl.org/net/ns/ex#Example>;
                                    rdfs:comment "Combined with other FOAF vocabularies, we can make a personal resume as a metadata. A career can be described with 'whois:career' property + 'whois:Education' or 'whois:Job' class, or sub properties 'whois:academicCareer' and 'whois:professionalCareer' that denote appropriate classes as range.",
                                                 "'whois:career'プロパティと'whois:Education', 'whois:Job'クラスを使って、履歴メタデータを記述する例。これらはサブプロパティ'whois:academicCareer'および'whois:professionalCareer'によってクラスを暗黙的に示すこともできる。"@ja.
<http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois> <http://purl.org/net/ns/ontology-annot#created> "2003-07-08";
                                  <http://purl.org/net/ns/ontology-annot#creator> <urn:pin:MK705>;
                                  <http://purl.org/net/ns/ontology-annot#modified> "2012-09-16";
                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>;
                                  rdfs:comment "An experimental vocabulary to describe a person's profile/history. Properties 'whois:stage' describe one's stage of life (whois:Stage). Similar to Ian Davis' BIO: vocab, however, while BIO: describes events on specific dates, this vocabulary uses whois:since/whois:until so that it can describe a period of time. This also includes such properties as career or honor to be used as a personal resume. Examples included in this document. ",
                                               "プロフィールを記述するための実験ボキャブラリ。Ian DavisのBIO: vocabと似ていますが、BIO:がEventという単位を基本に特定の日を記述するのに対し、こちらはライフサイクルのステージという概念で期間も記述できるようにしています。career, honorといったプロパティは、履歴メタデータの記述にも使えます。"@ja;
                                  rdfs:label "Who's who description vocabulary";
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/dliser.rdf>;
                                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Version 0.5.4. added whois:publication.".
whois:Education a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                rdfs:comment "A period of education in one's academic career, as a stage of life. NOT an activity of learning.",
                             "ライフステージ中での、学業期間。学歴を表す"@ja;
                rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                rdfs:label "Educaton (stage)";
                rdfs:subClassOf whois:Stage.
whois:Job a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
          rdfs:comment "A period of job in one's professional career, as a stage of life. NOT an activity of working.",
                       "ライフステージ中でのある職業の期間。職歴を表す"@ja;
          rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
          rdfs:label "Job (stage)";
          rdfs:subClassOf whois:Stage.
whois:Place a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
            rdfs:comment "A place -- this can be the domain of both contact: vocab and geo: vocab.",
                         "場所を表すクラス"@ja;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
            rdfs:label "Place";
            rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#SpatialThing>.
whois:Stage a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
            rdfs:comment "A stage of life. A distinct time period in a sequence of one's life cycle.",
                         "人生のあるステージ。人のライフサイクルの中での、はっきりと区切られる一時期"@ja;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
            rdfs:label "Stage".
whois:academicCareer a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                     rdfs:comment "an educational career in one's personal history.",
                                  "学歴を記述する。careerのサブプロパティ"@ja;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                     rdfs:label "Academic Career";
                     rdfs:range whois:Education;
                     rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:career.
whois:achievement a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                  rdfs:comment "a one's achievement in general. Note you can use foaf:pastProject for a specific achievement.",
                               "業績を記述する。careerのサブプロパティ"@ja;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                  rdfs:label "Achievement";
                  rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:career.
whois:born a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
           rdfs:comment "One's birthday. This can be used in place of 'whois:since' where the 'whois:Stage' is one's first stage.",
                        "誕生日を記述する。sinceのサブプロパティ（人生の最初のステージの始まり）"@ja;
           rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
           rdfs:label "Born";
           rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:since.
whois:career a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
             rdfs:comment "A job, education or any achievement in one's life, which can be specific to a stage of life (object = #Stage) or in general (object = any).",
                          "人生における職業、教育、業績などを記述する"@ja;
             rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
             rdfs:label "Career";
             rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:description.
whois:description a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                  rdfs:comment "General description of a person's activities. Use to describe something that does not fit into a Stage.",
                               "人の活動の一般的な記述。stage、career、planの上位プロパティ。一つのステージに収まらない事項を記述するためにも使える"@ja;
                  rdfs:domain <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person>;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                  rdfs:label "Description";
                  rdfs:range <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>.
whois:honor a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
            rdfs:comment "an honor that one has been rewarded.",
                         "顕彰歴を記述する。careerのサブプロパティ"@ja;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
            rdfs:label "Honor";
            rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:career.
whois:place a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
            rdfs:comment """Place which relates to a stage of life. Literal version of 'where'. \":x whois:place 'y'.\" implies \":x whois:where [rdfs:label 'y'].\".""",
                         "あるステージの場所をリテラルとして記述する"@ja;
            rdfs:domain whois:Stage;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
            rdfs:label "Place".
whois:plan a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
           rdfs:comment "General description of a person's future activities. Note past activity can be described with #career.",
                        "人の将来の活動予定を記述する"@ja;
           rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
           rdfs:label "Plan";
           rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:description.
whois:professionalCareer a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                         rdfs:comment "a professional or business career in one's personal history.",
                                      "職歴を記述する。careerのサブプロパティ"@ja;
                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                         rdfs:label "Professional Career";
                         rdfs:range whois:Job;
                         rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:career.
whois:publication a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                  rdfs:comment "a one's publication in general. Note foaf:publications describes publication list page.",
                               "出版物、論文を記述する。descriptionのサブプロパティ"@ja;
                  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
                  rdfs:label "Publication";
                  rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:description.
whois:since a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
            rdfs:comment "date when a stage of life started. ",
                         "あるステージが始まったときを記述する。whenのサブプロパティ"@ja;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
            rdfs:label "Since";
            rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:when,
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/12/cal/icaltzd#dtstart>.
whois:stage a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
            rdfs:comment "Describes an aspect of one's personal history. ",
                         "人の履歴のにおけるある切り口を記述する"@ja;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
            rdfs:label "Stage";
            rdfs:range whois:Stage;
            rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:description.
whois:until a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
            rdfs:comment "date when a stage of life ended.",
                         "あるステージが終わったときを記述する。whenのサブプロパティ"@ja;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
            rdfs:label "Until";
            rdfs:subPropertyOf whois:when,
                               <http://www.w3.org/2002/12/cal/icaltzd#dtend>.
whois:what a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
           rdfs:comment "Specifies a topic in a stage of life. The range is owl:Thing to have structured description. Use dc:description for literal description, or dc:subject for keywords.",
                        "あるステージを特徴付けるトピックを記述する（目的語はリテラルではないことに注意）"@ja;
           rdfs:domain whois:Stage;
           rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
           rdfs:label "What";
           rdfs:range <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing>;
           rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/topic>.
whois:when a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
           rdfs:comment "date/time which is related to a stage of life. Super property of since and until. W3C-DTF format value is assumed (i.e. can be yyyy, yyyy-mm, yyyy-mm-dd etc).",
                        "あるステージの時期を記述するための上位プロパティ"@ja;
           rdfs:domain whois:Stage;
           rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
           rdfs:label "When";
           rdfs:range rdfs:Literal.
whois:where a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
            rdfs:comment "Place which relates to a stage of life. The range is whois:Place to have structured description. Use bio:place for literal value",
                         "あるステージの場所を記述する"@ja;
            rdfs:domain whois:Stage;
            rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.kanzaki.com/ns/whois>;
            rdfs:label "Where";
            rdfs:range whois:Place.
<http://www.w3.org/2002/12/cal/icaltzd#dtend> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
<http://www.w3.org/2002/12/cal/icaltzd#dtstart> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
<http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#SpatialThing> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/topic> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
<urn:pin:MK705> a <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person>;
                rdfs:seeAlso <http://www.kanzaki.com/info/webwho.rdf>;
                <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "神崎正英"@ja.
